{"id": 3674, "jp_tail": "たくはなかった。", "zh": "说实话，『那个场面』我并不太想让彩野同学看到。", "score": 88, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 3675, "jp_tail": "……", "zh": "……", "score": 95, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
